# viewtest: an independent app window (E7).  "Neues Fenster" opens a WF_APP window: no title bar
# of the library, its own from titlebar_begin / titlebar_end with a tab in it; the caption
# buttons ask the window manager for that window (headless runs record it: expect wm).
click "Neues Fenster"
window any
expect titlebar:"Privates Fenster" exists
expect "Tab Eins" exists
click "Tab Eins"
expect text:"Tab geklickt: 1" exists
# the caption buttons of its own title bar
click button:"Minimize"
expect wm minimize
click button:"Maximize"
expect wm maximize
click button:"Close"
expect wm close
